cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite this software package and the related publications listed in the README."
title: "LFP SOC and SOH Estimation"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-03
abstract: >-
  Reproducible reference implementations for LFP battery state-of-charge
  estimation using a reverse first-order model with LSTM, and state-of-health
  estimation using short-pulse U1-U21 features with Random Forest.
